<!doctype lake><title>🚋 𝓜𝓮𝓰𝓪𝓽𝓻𝓸𝓷</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="ddSNs" id="ddSNs" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u85fef306" id="u85fef306"> </span><span data-lake-id="ubdded42d" id="ubdded42d">🐊</span><span data-lake-id="u67be5e12" id="u67be5e12"> 𝐆𝐫𝐚𝐝𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐂𝐡𝐞𝐜𝐤𝐩𝐨𝐢𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐧𝐠: 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐃𝐞𝐞𝐩 𝐍𝐞𝐭𝐬 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐒𝐮𝐛𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐞𝐚𝐫 𝐌𝐞𝐦𝐨𝐫𝐲 𝐂𝐨𝐬𝐭</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u1c698bf4" id="u1c698bf4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u945e5e08" id="u945e5e08">本文提出一种系统性方法，用于降低深度神经网络训练过程中的内存消耗。主要关注如何减少存储中间结果（特征图）及梯度所需的内存，因为在许多常见的深度网络架构中，参数所占用的存储空间相较于中间特征图而言较小</span></strong></p><ul list="uddc8ce96"><li fid="u466492cb" data-lake-id="ue2f504d4" id="ue2f504d4"><span data-lake-id="u2e29f15d" id="u2e29f15d">通过计算图分析，自动执行原地操作和内存共享优化。更为关键的是，提出一种以计算换取内存的新方法。基于这一方法，给出一种实用算法：对于一个包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bD8Ny%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3123d7ce" id="u3123d7ce">层的网络，仅需将前向传播的计算开销增加至原来的两倍，即可将特征图的存储开销降至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(%5C%5Csqrt%7Bn%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdcc6e7e33516b8c7bf42843b63579eb4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LX2cn%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u466492cb" data-lake-id="ud35ee54f" id="ud35ee54f"><span data-lake-id="u30692de5" id="u30692de5">证明在极端情况下，训练一个包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22h1cNe%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u465729ba" id="u465729ba">层的网络时，特征图的存储开销可以低至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(%5C%5Clog%20n)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2fdf253e5f6e53f0241609dad83d80a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ii2J3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1e1e9546" id="u1e1e9546">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua5acf101" id="ua5acf101"><strong><span data-lake-id="u55018d0c" id="u55018d0c">由于存储特征图及其梯度的开销随网络深度线性增长，探索更深模型的能力受到设备内存容量的限制。由于最优模型的规模与复杂度通常会随着训练数据量的增加而增长，因此，具备较高内存效率的训练算法至关重要</span></strong></p><ul list="u0c30213b"><li fid="ua5eca670" data-lake-id="u89ffca84" id="u89ffca84"><span data-lake-id="udc82bbad" id="udc82bbad">降低内存消耗不仅能够支持更大规模模型的训练，还允许采用更大的批大小，从而提高设备利用率，并改善批归一化等按批次计算的算子的稳定性</span></li><li fid="ua5eca670" data-lake-id="u763b696b" id="u763b696b"><span data-lake-id="u3c45a7f5" id="u3c45a7f5">对于内存受限的设备，这有助于改善内存访问的局部性，并可能带来更优的内存访问模式。此外，在训练深度卷积神经网络时，降低内存消耗还使能够从模型并行切换至数据并行，这在某些情况下能够带来收益</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="gPnxX" id="gPnxX" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ua2e3d9c2" id="ua2e3d9c2">🏗️</span><span data-lake-id="u22f6b4db" id="u22f6b4db"> 𝐌𝐞𝐦𝐨𝐫𝐲 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐂𝐨𝐦𝐩𝐮𝐭𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐆𝐫𝐚𝐩𝐡</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ua9afd32d" id="ua9afd32d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3a7b750d" id="u3a7b750d">计算图由表示运算的节点以及表示运算之间依赖关系的边组成。给定网络配置，即前向计算图后，可以构建相应的反向路径以计算梯度。具体而言，按照逆拓扑序遍历网络配置，并像常规反向传播算法一样应用反向算子，即可构建反向路径</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="udd6093c0" id="udd6093c0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790937222865-39ab0694-af12-4809-8a63-4289b61d6536.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ud20894d4-3267-48f4-83f1-bfcc84456b1%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ud1016749-60d4-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A799%2C%22height%22%3A270%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A143133%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1595%2C%22originHeight%22%3A539%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22MEMORYALLOCATIONFOREACHOUTPUTOFOP%2CSAME%22%2C%22x%22%3A526%2C%22y%22%3A467%2C%22width%22%3A518%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NETWORKCONFIGURATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A34%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A274%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COLORINDICATESSHAREDMEMORY.%22%2C%22x%22%3A529%2C%22y%22%3A498%2C%22width%22%3A371%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ADIENTCALCULATIONGRA%22%2C%22x%22%3A455%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A278%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DATADEPENDENCY%22%2C%22x%22%3A131%2C%22y%22%3A470%2C%22width%22%3A202%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFTMAX-BACKWA%22%2C%22x%22%3A701%2C%22y%22%3A343%2C%22width%22%3A155%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SOFTMAX-BACKWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A1289%2C%22y%22%3A353%2C%22width%22%3A195%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SIGMOID-BACKWAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A691%2C%22y%22%3A222%2C%22width%22%3A179%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFTMAX-FONWAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A948%2C%22y%22%3A346%2C%22width%22%3A149%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SOFTMAX-FORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A13%2C%22y%22%3A341%2C%22width%22%3A156%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SIGMOID-FORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A334%2C%22y%22%3A216%2C%22width%22%3A169%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SIGMOID-BACKWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A1294%2C%22y%22%3A231%2C%22width%22%3A203%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SIGMOID-FORWARO%22%2C%22x%22%3A18%2C%22y%22%3A222%2C%22width%22%3A157%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FULLC-BACKWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A1294%2C%22y%22%3A171%2C%22width%22%3A156%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FULLC-BACKWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A1295%2C%22y%22%3A292%2C%22width%22%3A155%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IGMOID-FONWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A953%2C%22y%22%3A227%2C%22width%22%3A161%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CATIONPLA%22%2C%22x%22%3A1247%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A115%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FULLC-FORWARC%22%2C%22x%22%3A364%2C%22y%22%3A276%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FULLC-FORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A983%2C%22y%22%3A290%2C%22width%22%3A126%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FULLCBACKWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A687%2C%22y%22%3A162%2C%22width%22%3A153%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FULLC-FORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A43%2C%22y%22%3A277%2C%22width%22%3A128%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FULLC-FORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A966%2C%22y%22%3A165%2C%22width%22%3A147%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FULLC-BACKWARC%22%2C%22x%22%3A695%2C%22y%22%3A283%2C%22width%22%3A138%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FULLC-FORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A373%2C%22y%22%3A152%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PUT-GRAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A1236%2C%22y%22%3A77%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FULLC-FORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A55%2C%22y%22%3A160%2C%22width%22%3A141%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUT-GRAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A612%2C%22y%22%3A67%2C%22width%22%3A121%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OPERATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A879%2C%22y%22%3A130%2C%22width%22%3A123%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POSSIBL%22%2C%22x%22%3A1083%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A96%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOG-LOSS%22%2C%22x%22%3A1029%2C%22y%22%3A410%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPLACE%22%2C%22x%22%3A880%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SHARING%22%2C%22x%22%3A1475%2C%22y%22%3A117%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LABEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A674%2C%22y%22%3A403%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MEMORY%22%2C%22x%22%3A1477%2C%22y%22%3A89%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OG-LOS%22%2C%22x%22%3A424%2C%22y%22%3A402%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SOFTMAX-FONWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A335%2C%22y%22%3A333%2C%22width%22%3A167%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LABEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A1281%2C%22y%22%3A411%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A1096%2C%22y%22%3A74%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A492%2C%22y%22%3A62%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A115%2C%22y%22%3A70%2C%22width%22%3A129%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A591%2C%22y%22%3A279%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%226E%22%2C%22x%22%3A1148%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f2f2f1%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u658e6987%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud3eb02fd" id="ud3eb02fd"><span data-lake-id="u2c6fcc13" id="u2c6fcc13">在训练深度卷积神经网络或循环神经网络时，通常有很大一部分内存用于存储中间输出及梯度。每个中间结果都对应计算图中的一个节点。合理的内存分配算法能够尽可能通过内存共享，为这些节点分配最少的内存</span></p><ul list="u025eb9ee"><li fid="u2a671d46" data-lake-id="u0bfb9e97" id="u0bfb9e97"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc91d8d32" id="uc91d8d32">原地操作（Inplace operation）：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u01510207" id="u01510207"> 将输出值直接存储到某个输入值所占用的内存中</span></li><li fid="u2a671d46" data-lake-id="u32f98bbc" id="u32f98bbc"><strong><span data-lake-id="ube78bec7" id="ube78bec7">内存共享（Memory sharing）：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uef7b76f3" id="uef7b76f3"> 回收不再需要的中间结果所占用的内存，并将其用于其他节点</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf4a324ee" id="uf4a324ee"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6649f4d8" id="u6649f4d8">算法按拓扑序遍历计算图，并使用计数器表示每条记录的活跃状态。当不存在其他尚未执行且依赖于某个输入的运算时，就可以对该输入执行原地操作。当某个已回收的标记被另一个节点使用时，就实现内存共享。这一方法也可以作为动态运行时算法，在遍历计算图的过程中，利用垃圾回收器回收不再使用的内存。将其用作静态内存分配算法，在执行开始之前为各个节点分配内存，以避免运行时垃圾回收带来的开销</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uff5f8f65" id="uff5f8f65" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790937409648-0134425b-061f-4dec-915c-8cbb9a11741d.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u285b1006-c8c3-41c3-a278-4de8f0963ad%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ud1016749-60d4-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A777%2C%22height%22%3A299%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A117063%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1290%2C%22originHeight%22%3A497%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22NTREFCOUNTERONDEPENDENTOPERATIONSTHAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A484%2C%22y%22%3A361%2C%22width%22%3A341%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DATADEPENDENCY.OPERATIONNOTCOMPLETED%22%2C%22x%22%3A459%2C%22y%22%3A452%2C%22width%22%3A397%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FINALMEMORYPLAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A86%2C%22y%22%3A284%2C%22width%22%3A197%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DATADEPENDENCY%2COPERATIONCOMPLETED%22%2C%22x%22%3A509%2C%22y%22%3A414%2C%22width%22%3A304%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BOXOFFREETAGSINALLOCATIONALGORITHM%22%2C%22x%22%3A955%2C%22y%22%3A388%2C%22width%22%3A298%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INTERNALARRAYSSAMECOLORINDICATESSHARED%22%2C%22x%22%3A514%2C%22y%22%3A317%2C%22width%22%3A340%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TAGUSEDTOINDICATEMEMORYSHARINGON%22%2C%22x%22%3A965%2C%22y%22%3A314%2C%22width%22%3A302%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STEP5%3ARE-USETAGOFE%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A1087%2C%22y%22%3A222%2C%22width%22%3A157%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALLOCATIONALGORITHM.%22%2C%22x%22%3A964%2C%22y%22%3A334%2C%22width%22%3A149%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORF%2CRELEASESPACE%22%2C%22x%22%3A710%2C%22y%22%3A235%2C%22width%22%3A134%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STEP4%3AREUSETHETAC%22%2C%22x%22%3A905%2C%22y%22%3A220%2C%22width%22%3A137%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22YETTOBEFULL-FILLED%22%2C%22x%22%3A517%2C%22y%22%3A381%2C%22width%22%3A209%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORC%2CCANNOTDO%22%2C%22x%22%3A510%2C%22y%22%3A238%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LLOCATIONALGORITHM%22%2C%22x%22%3A84%2C%22y%22%3A239%2C%22width%22%3A124%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THISISANINPLACE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1089%2C%22y%22%3A242%2C%22width%22%3A126%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPLACEBECAUSEBIS%22%2C%22x%22%3A513%2C%22y%22%3A258%2C%22width%22%3A139%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E%3DPOOLING(C)%22%2C%22x%22%3A12%2C%22y%22%3A165%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INTHEBOXFORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A904%2C%22y%22%3A236%2C%22width%22%3A118%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STEP3%3AALLOCATETAG%22%2C%22x%22%3A712%2C%22y%22%3A217%2C%22width%22%3A133%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STEP2%3AALLOCATETAG%22%2C%22x%22%3A513%2C%22y%22%3A220%2C%22width%22%3A125%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STEP1%3AALLOCAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A336%2C%22y%22%3A219%2C%22width%22%3A92%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B%3DSIGMOID(A%22%2C%22x%22%3A10%2C%22y%22%3A81%2C%22width%22%3A108%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MEMONY.%22%2C%22x%22%3A506%2C%22y%22%3A339%2C%22width%22%3A229%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TAGFORB%22%2C%22x%22%3A333%2C%22y%22%3A237%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NITIALSTATEOF%22%2C%22x%22%3A84%2C%22y%22%3A221%2C%22width%22%3A108%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89POOLING(E%22%2C%22x%22%3A209%2C%22y%22%3A97%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OPTIMIZATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A1089%2C%22y%22%3A260%2C%22width%22%3A114%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3DSIGMOID(B%22%2C%22x%22%3A13%2C%22y%22%3A124%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STILLALIVE%22%2C%22x%22%3A511%2C%22y%22%3A276%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221G%3DEF%22%2C%22x%22%3A180%2C%22y%22%3A181%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFB%22%2C%22x%22%3A709%2C%22y%22%3A253%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COUNTREFCOU%22%2C%22x%22%3A458%2C%22y%22%3A363%2C%22width%22%3A115%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BA%8C%22%2C%22x%22%3A989%2C%22y%22%3A92%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%B1%B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A982%2C%22y%22%3A147%2C%22width%22%3A18%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%A3%22%2C%22x%22%3A123%2C%22y%22%3A41%2C%22width%22%3A17%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220%22%2C%22x%22%3A940%2C%22y%22%3A57%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220%22%2C%22x%22%3A1114%2C%22y%22%3A166%2C%22width%22%3A16%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A745%2C%22y%22%3A147%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222%22%2C%22x%22%3A124%2C%22y%22%3A76%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221%22%2C%22x%22%3A987%2C%22y%22%3A104%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A158%2C%22y%22%3A379%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%B1%B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A778%2C%22y%22%3A146%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f5f5%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u221a6dd7%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="u0fca81fe"><li fid="u6d14868d" data-lake-id="u8458a466" id="u8458a466"><span data-lake-id="ud414e1e0" id="ud414e1e0">数据依赖关系会延长各个输出的生命周期，并增加大型网络的内存消耗。因此，深度学习框架应当：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3d27a587" id="u3d27a587" style="color: #664900">仅声明梯度算子所必需的依赖关系。基于依赖信息进行活跃性分析，并支持内存共享</span></strong></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="HfgHO" id="HfgHO" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u85221097" id="u85221097">🌊</span><span data-lake-id="ua8973f46" id="ua8973f46"> 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐝𝐞 𝐂𝐨𝐦𝐩𝐮𝐭𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐟𝐨𝐫 𝐌𝐞𝐦𝐨𝐫𝐲</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u7dce797a" id="u7dce797a"><strong><span data-lake-id="udc15c8a2" id="udc15c8a2" style="color: #270070">由于大多数梯度算子依赖于前向传播的中间结果，在训练一个包含</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xgg7X%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2668cc2c" id="u2668cc2c" style="color: #270070">层的卷积神经网络，或处理长度为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wz6L2%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u53f71d9f" id="u53f71d9f" style="color: #270070">的序列的循环神经网络时，仍然需要</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(n)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe65a67ac353abeeff44c359310d05c02.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22b4c4p%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u025ad070" id="u025ad070" style="color: #270070">的内存来存储中间结果。为进一步降低内存消耗，提出丢弃部分</span></strong><em><strong><span data-lake-id="u8700be97" id="u8700be97" style="color: #270070">中间结果</span></strong></em><strong><span data-lake-id="ub0e59ac4" id="ub0e59ac4" style="color: #270070">，并在需要时通过额外的前向计算恢复这些结果</span></strong></p><ul list="u0fecf6e3"><li fid="u572baa4c" data-lake-id="u2defaf65" id="u2defaf65"><span data-lake-id="u49b3e876" id="u49b3e876">具体而言，在反向传播阶段，可以从最近的已保存结果出发，执行前向计算，重新生成被丢弃的中间结果。具体而言，将神经网络划分为若干区段，算法仅保存各区段的输出，并丢弃区段内部的全部中间结果。在反向传播过程中，以区段为单位重新计算这些被丢弃的结果。因此，所需内存仅包括存储各区段输出的开销，以及各区段执行反向传播时所需内存的最大值</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u89fc9fda" id="u89fc9fda"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9e5f2c76" id="u9e5f2c76">基于相同的核心思想，引入一种通用的梯度图构建算法</span></strong></p><ul list="u63a3aa33"><li fid="u9b812715" data-lake-id="u6ff8d44b" id="u6ff8d44b"><span data-lake-id="u9d89adbd" id="u9d89adbd">在该算法中，用户在计算图的节点上定义函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m%3A%5C%5Cmathcal%7BV%7D%5C%5Crightarrow%5C%5Cmathbb%7BN%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5ecdf2158f88b448c947cf9dec964a9a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d8r6S%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3703c008" id="u3703c008">，用于指定某个结果可以被重新计算的次数。由于重计算本质上是在复制节点，即对节点进行镜像，将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4760e2f007e23d820825ba241c47ce3b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g0hlg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ueb3bef75" id="ueb3bef75">称为镜像计数函数。当所有镜像计数均设为 0 时，该算法退化为常规梯度图的构建过程</span></li><li fid="u9b812715" data-lake-id="u8dad5442" id="u8dad5442"><span data-lake-id="u106bbbf9" id="u106bbbf9">指定上述重计算模式，用户只需对各区段内部的节点设置</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m(v)%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd5fad39a2d5b0feb4fc21dbce4688143.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ejx9E%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc8c6202f" id="uc8c6202f">，并对各区段的输出节点设置</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m(v)%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff09189ffb0fcb3d76825714ed3b833da.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IGkjo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u09b28daa" id="u09b28daa">。镜像计数也可以大于 1，由此可以得到递归形式的推广</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uac364623" id="uac364623" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790937927240-f7a87546-328f-452e-b92a-f8ec1b1214ed.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u1fef72c5-6241-49b7-9f60-e3bb3ab291e%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ub9c8097c-1d7f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A841.4000244140625%2C%22height%22%3A358%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A113010%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1178%2C%22originHeight%22%3A501%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22MEMORYALLOCATIONFOREACHOUTPUTOFOP%2CSAME%22%2C%22x%22%3A659%2C%22y%22%3A452%2C%22width%22%3A386%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DATADEPENDENCY----CONTROLDEPENDENC%22%2C%22x%22%3A195%2C%22y%22%3A450%2C%22width%22%3A386%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COLORINDICATESSHAREDMEMORY.%22%2C%22x%22%3A659%2C%22y%22%3A475%2C%22width%22%3A293%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RELU-BACKWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A962%2C%22y%22%3A239%2C%22width%22%3A109%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GRADIENTGRAPH%22%2C%22x%22%3A437%2C%22y%22%3A48%2C%22width%22%3A152%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MEMORYOPTIMIZED%22%2C%22x%22%3A810%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A170%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GRADIENTGRAPH%22%2C%22x%22%3A812%2C%22y%22%3A45%2C%22width%22%3A163%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NETWORK%22%2C%22x%22%3A188%2C%22y%22%3A25%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONV-FORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A97%2C%22y%22%3A284%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONV-BACKWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A967%2C%22y%22%3A287%2C%22width%22%3A112%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONV-BACKWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A962%2C%22y%22%3A149%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONV-FORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A97%2C%22y%22%3A156%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ONFIGURATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A174%2C%22y%22%3A50%2C%22width%22%3A121%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LU-BACKWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A580%2C%22y%22%3A237%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RELU-BACKWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A965%2C%22y%22%3A378%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RELU-FORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A702%2C%22y%22%3A371%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BN-BACKWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A960%2C%22y%22%3A194%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NV-BACKWAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A583%2C%22y%22%3A282%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22N-BACKWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A574%2C%22y%22%3A190%2C%22width%22%3A92%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RELU-FONWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A318%2C%22y%22%3A238%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BN-BACKWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A962%2C%22y%22%3A332%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ONV-BACKWAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A574%2C%22y%22%3A144%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RELU-FONWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A107%2C%22y%22%3A378%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RELU-FONWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A108%2C%22y%22%3A246%2C%22width%22%3A92%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONV-FORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A312%2C%22y%22%3A275%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUT-GRAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A457%2C%22y%22%3A75%2C%22width%22%3A137%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NORMAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A459%2C%22y%22%3A24%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BN-FONWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A106%2C%22y%22%3A201%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BN-FORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A710%2C%22y%22%3A194%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22N-FONWARC%22%2C%22x%22%3A719%2C%22y%22%3A325%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONV-FONWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A691%2C%22y%22%3A149%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ELU-FONWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A703%2C%22y%22%3A237%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RELU-FORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A319%2C%22y%22%3A369%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ELU-BACKWAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A576%2C%22y%22%3A375%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BN-FORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A321%2C%22y%22%3A192%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACKWAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A594%2C%22y%22%3A328%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONV-FORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A308%2C%22y%22%3A146%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BN-FORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A117%2C%22y%22%3A331%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONV-FORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A679%2C%22y%22%3A279%2C%22width%22%3A113%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BN-FORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A327%2C%22y%22%3A320%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUT-GRAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A892%2C%22y%22%3A75%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A425%2C%22y%22%3A79%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A844%2C%22y%22%3A375%2C%22width%22%3A113%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A209%2C%22y%22%3A86%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22N-BA%22%2C%22x%22%3A572%2C%22y%22%3A329%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A802%2C%22y%22%3A74%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A839%2C%22y%22%3A218%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MEMORVAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A628%2C%22y%22%3A451%2C%22width%22%3A120%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A433%2C%22y%22%3A391%2C%22width%22%3A19%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%B8%82%22%2C%22x%22%3A807%2C%22y%22%3A406%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L%22%2C%22x%22%3A793%2C%22y%22%3A362%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f4f3f3%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u13419b49%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf43459f9" id="uf43459f9"><strong><span data-lake-id="u836ed721" id="u836ed721" style="color: #004347">上述通用方法的一种直接应用，是丢弃低开销运算的结果，并保留计算耗时较长的结果。这通常适用于卷积神经网络中的 Conv-BatchNorm-Activation 计算流程。可以始终保留卷积运算的结果，同时丢弃批归一化、激活函数和池化运算的结果。由于批归一化和激活函数的计算开销都较低，因此在实际应用中，这种方法能够以很小的额外计算开销节省内存</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u58ec783f" id="u58ec783f"><span data-lake-id="ueee8ab8d" id="ueee8ab8d">假设将一个包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c0TwF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u077d03e4" id="u077d03e4">层的网络划分为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JihzL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue5613bd1" id="ue5613bd1">个区段，则训练该网络所需的内存开销如下</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc9cd05a4" id="uc9cd05a4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctext%7Bcost-total%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmax_%7Bi%3D1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Ck%7D%5C%5Ctext%7Bcost-of-segment%7D(i)%20%2B%20O(k)%20%3D%20O%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7Bn%7D%7Bk%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%20O(k)%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1675fea7909acb0ffd60c1d6eb92640f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z1WeV%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue495ad78"><li fid="u8e99c35c" data-lake-id="u36d08a5e" id="u36d08a5e"><span data-lake-id="ue4fe1972" id="ue4fe1972">式中的第一部分表示在各区段上执行反向传播所需的内存开销。若各区段均匀划分，则该开销为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(n%2Fk)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F693e93edb25a0e15b843eebd79a58401.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dmsao%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3413edc7" id="u3413edc7">。第二部分表示存储区段之间中间输出的开销。令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%3D%5C%5Csqrt%7Bn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fce660a167c1928365f4ec75e22ab6933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HVXHY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2777e77f" id="u2777e77f">，即可得到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(2%5C%5Csqrt%7Bn%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F339eb551c4f70316a9ba52035e961b69.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TzJAy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udf7a6980" id="udf7a6980"> 的内存开销</span></li><li fid="u8e99c35c" data-lake-id="u25b2af53" id="u25b2af53"><span data-lake-id="u09f810e1" id="u09f810e1">该算法仅需在训练过程中额外执行一次前向传播，便能将内存开销降低至次线性水平。由于反向运算的耗时接近前向运算的两倍，因此，这只会使整体计算速度略有下降</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0e592e46" id="u0e592e46" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790938231277-086bc399-4b10-4274-ac0b-93532b760540.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u6b5872b4-3660-47c2-92e0-a22cc6b2fc8%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ub9c8097c-1d7f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A571%2C%22height%22%3A271%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A56189%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A855%2C%22originHeight%22%3A406%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22SAMECOLORINDICATESSHAREDMEMORY.%22%2C%22x%22%3A407%2C%22y%22%3A362%2C%22width%22%3A351%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MEMORYALLOCATIONFOREACHOUTPUTOFOP.%22%2C%22x%22%3A403%2C%22y%22%3A336%2C%22width%22%3A373%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DATADEPENDENCY%22%2C%22x%22%3A145%2C%22y%22%3A336%2C%22width%22%3A161%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONV-BN-RELU%22%2C%22x%22%3A348%2C%22y%22%3A246%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BN-BACKWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A635%2C%22y%22%3A85%2C%22width%22%3A112%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONV-BACKWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A639%2C%22y%22%3A187%2C%22width%22%3A126%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RELU-BACKWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A635%2C%22y%22%3A133%2C%22width%22%3A122%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONV-BN-RELU%22%2C%22x%22%3A63%2C%22y%22%3A175%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONV-BN-RELU%22%2C%22x%22%3A63%2C%22y%22%3A261%2C%22width%22%3A108%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A96%2C%22y%22%3A198%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONV-BN-RELU%22%2C%22x%22%3A343%2C%22y%22%3A158%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A97%2C%22y%22%3A283%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUT-GRAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A292%2C%22y%22%3A45%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BACKWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A349%2C%22y%22%3A268%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BACKWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A344%2C%22y%22%3A180%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A171%2C%22y%22%3A46%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A491%2C%22y%22%3A29%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2211114%22%2C%22x%22%3A484%2C%22y%22%3A11%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f5f5%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u7655eefb%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u715245d7" id="u715245d7"><strong><span data-lake-id="ueebf0cf9" id="ueebf0cf9">从另一种视角解释上述内存优化方案。可以将每个区段视为一个复合算子，将区段内部的全部运算封装在一起。该复合算子通过执行描述其内部计算过程的子图来计算梯度。这一视角使能够将一系列运算视为子程序。子图内部的优化不会影响外部计算，因此，可以将所提出的内存优化方案递归地应用于各个子图</span></strong></p><ul list="u4c89ecbd"><li fid="u0ad86a0e" data-lake-id="u5d52d55a" id="u5d52d55a"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufa7af069" id="ufa7af069">通过递归进一步降低内存开销：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue5515050" id="ue5515050">令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g(n)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F50c993b622ed440989d8161d6ec46381.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22A8uMh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0de1d217" id="u0de1d217">表示在一个包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tPgT0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uac0ee3bc" id="uac0ee3bc">层的神经网络上执行前向传播和反向传播所需的内存开销。假设在计算图中保存</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AQSjl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uee929365" id="uee929365">个中间结果，并在对子路径执行前向传播和反向传播时递归地应用同一策略，则有如下递推关系：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue26c6119" id="ue26c6119" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g(n)%20%3D%20k%20%2B%20g%5C%5Cleft(n%2F(k%2B1)%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F42f0372dccbdaf25fd9a822a23bd8460.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JNKNV%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u1f10707f" id="u1f10707f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g(n)%20%3D%20k%5C%5Clog_%7Bk%2B1%7D(n)%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8049c667435aa625121de6844c353946.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MXzX5%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uebe4ac8e"><li fid="u29ac2735" data-lake-id="u65c54317" id="u65c54317"><span data-lake-id="u084d440b" id="u084d440b">作为一种特殊情况，令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F29451a8fe9e2c369b77e30ea1655ac46.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LxIX1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6bc4eb46" id="u6bc4eb46">，即可得到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g(n)%3D%5C%5Clog_2%20n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F05d1910b7d9ec6da2efd30a5ba97ce95.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cJxin%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u42f1cb25" id="u42f1cb25">。因为现有实现训练一个包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PhG4F%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc83b8a2b" id="uc83b8a2b">层的神经网络时，都需要</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(n)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe65a67ac353abeeff44c359310d05c02.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WrDVY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3d7f6c1c" id="u3d7f6c1c"> 的内存来存储特征图。这一方案需要付出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(%5C%5Clog_2%20n)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fefaaf0926c6d36e3607de6aedc9676a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wk8Mn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub2709008" id="ub2709008">的前向传播计算开销，因此可能不会被普遍采用，但它展示如何通过递归进一步以计算换取内存</span></li></ul>